        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Acorn RLDBP, Rough Iron Cabinet Latch</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis early American rough iron latch gives an old world charm to cabinet doors, or anywhere a small latch can be used. The Acorn ALJBR Cabinet Latch has a traditional ball-end lift bar. For use with Flush Cabinet Doors where the face of the door is flush with the cabinet's face. Just screw the latch and catch plates to the cabinet and doors faces with the included screws.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Acorn RLDBP Cabinet Latch:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Rough Black Iron</b></li>\r\n<li>Width: 2-5/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Height: 2-1/2\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
